msgid ""
" * La 'Retención procesada, línea xml generada'\n"
"               es usada cuando el usuario procesa la Retencion de ISLR.\n"
"               * La 'Retencion no Procesada' state es cuando un usuario realiza una factura y se genera el documento de retencion de islr y aun no esta procesado.\n"
"               * 'No exceda la tasa, línea XML generada' se utiliza cuando el usuario crea la factura, una factura no supera la tarifa mínima."
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_ve_full
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ve_full.field_account_move_line__state
msgid ""
" * The 'Draft' status is used when a user is encoding a new and unconfirmed Invoice.\n"
" * The 'Pro-forma' status is used when the invoice does not have an invoice number.\n"
" * The 'Open' status is used when user creates invoice, an invoice number is generated. It stays in the open status till the user pays the invoice.\n"
" * The 'Paid' status is set automatically when the invoice is paid. Its related journal entries may or may not be reconciled.\n"
" * The 'Cancelled' status is used when user cancel invoice."
msgstr ""

